flowchart LR
  Q[question] --> RW[rewrite node]
  RW --> RT[retrieve node<br/>FAISS flat, top 12]
  RT --> RR[rerank node<br/>blend, keep 4]
  RR --> GEN[generate node<br/>stand-in or live adapter]
  GEN --> ANS[answer + citations]
  RW -. trace record .-> TR[(per-node trace)]
  RT -. trace record .-> TR
  RR -. trace record .-> TR
  GEN -. trace record .-> TR
  TR --> AT[attributor]
  GL[(golden label)] --> AT
  AT --> V{verdict}
  V -->|exit 0| D[stage named]
  V -->|exit 1| B[both]
  V -->|exit 2| R[refused]
  INJ[seeded injector] -. mode, never in trace .-> GEN
  INJ ==> GT[ground truth]
  GT --> SCORE[attribution accuracy]
  AT --> SCORE
